youko Ikumi - decide to join the drama club. Respectively, Fumi decides to join the literary club and along the way mistakens Yasuko - the cool, boyish upper classman who is part of the basketball club - as part of the literary club. Yasuko later decides to make a guest appearance at Akira and Kyouko's club.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c9BzqZ2IZoM8lMia6HgK8qfDsfa.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Through this chance reunion between these two childhood friends, both Akira and Fumi make a promise to go to school together despite the fact that they attend two different schools, while still making other friends along the way. Almost as if they were making up for lost time, the intimacy between the two starts to deepen. Entering school and overcome with excitement, Akira and fellow classmate - Kyouko Ikumi - decide to join the drama club. Respectively, Fumi decides to join the literary club and along the way mistakens Yasuko - the cool, boyish upper classman who is part of the basketball club - as part of the literary club. Yasuko later decides to make a guest appearance at Akira and Kyouko's club.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c9BzqZ2IZoM8lMia6HgK8qfDsfa.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6443","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34838","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"81294","synopsis":"Planning to back out of joining the basketball club, Fumi is asked out on a date by her senpai - Yasuko Sugimoto. While thrown off guard and a bit flustered, she is surprisingly happy on the inside. However, Akira is invited to a mixer by her classmate Kyouko, whose fiance Kou Sawanoi, will be attending. For some reason, maybe the anticipation of meeting Kou, Akira left her home nervous and on edge. Meanwhile on that very day, Fumi and her senpai had a surprisingly quiet and pleasant time together. As the distance between them began to shorten at the library, they leaned in for their first kiss...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/18kOw0VXi9r4PRpnwIY9HAEmajE.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Planning to back out of joining the basketball club, Fumi is asked out on a date by her senpai - Yasuko Sugimoto. While thrown off guard and a bit flustered, she is surprisingly happy on the inside. However, Akira is invited to a mixer by her classmate Kyouko, whose fiance Kou Sawanoi, will be attending. For some reason, maybe the anticipation of meeting Kou, Akira left her home nervous and on edge. Meanwhile on that very day, Fumi and her senpai had a surprisingly quiet and pleasant time together. As the distance between them began to shorten at the library, they leaned in for their first kiss...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/18kOw0VXi9r4PRpnwIY9HAEmajE.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6443","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34838","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"81293","synopsis":"After being asked by Yasuko to accompany her to school, Fumi worries about who to walk to school with: her childhood friend or girl who she likes. When revealing her predicament to Akira, she laughs and they come up with a solution to her problem. In the meantime, Kyouko starts to inquire about Yasuko...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1qcNqtxnYJ7NeLGV7NZNuYPxaSS.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"After being asked by Yasuko to accompany her to school, Fumi worries about who to walk to school with: her childhood friend or girl who she likes. When revealing her predicament to Akira, she laughs and they come up with a solution to her problem. In the meantime, Kyouko starts to inquire about Yasuko...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1qcNqtxnYJ7NeLGV7NZNuYPxaSS.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6443","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34838","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"81295","synopsis":"Preparations for the school production and upper classmen's musical number are in full swing. With Yasuko making a guest appearance as the protagonist, Heathcliff, many of her fans have gathered in great excitement to see her performance. However, there's only on person on her mind: Fumi. Kyouko approaches Yasuko and carefully acknowledges that she knows about her and Fumi, which brings about some uneasiness to Fumi. This causes her to ask Yasuko a question about her first love.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A0uZiPwCJGLPTBjFRdeQy4bFy2I.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Preparations for the school production and upper classmen's musical number are in full swing. With Yasuko making a guest appearance as the protagonist, Heathcliff, many of her fans have gathered in great excitement to see her performance. However, there's only on person on her mind: Fumi. Kyouko approaches Yasuko and carefully acknowledges that she knows about her and Fumi, which brings about some uneasiness to Fumi. This causes her to ask Yasuko a question about her first love.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A0uZiPwCJGLPTBjFRdeQy4bFy2I.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6443","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34838","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"81296","synopsis":"Finally the day of the Fujigaya's performance has arrived. The first years start off with a performance of \"Le Petit Prince,\" followed by the second year's \"Little Women.\" Finally the upper classmen begin their performance of \"Wurthering Heights.\" Fumi heart skips a beat at the sight of Yasuko's performance on stage. At the end of the performance, Fumi is taken aback as her senpai starts to cry.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eHedYRLyAT9nn4BmoGMwWx0SZeD.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Finally the day of the Fujigaya's performance has arrived. The first years start off with a performance of \"Le Petit Prince,\" followed by the second year's \"Little Women.\" Finally the upper classmen begin their performance of \"Wurthering Heights.\" Fumi heart skips a beat at the sight of Yasuko's performance on stage. At the end of the performance, Fumi is taken aback as her senpai starts to cry.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eHedYRLyAT9nn4BmoGMwWx0SZeD.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6443","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34838","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"81298","synopsis":"The day after Fujigaya's theatrical festival, Akira and Fumi head off to Yokohama for a day to play. On that day, Fumi decided to stay over at Akira's place, making Yasuko a bit uneasy as she expressed her thoughts to Akira. After hearing Akira's thoughts on the matter, Yasuko decided to let it go. However, she later decides to invite Fumi to her home...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/avOumsF3jwMtVGZ6JjGKNhPW0hV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"The day after Fujigaya's theatrical festival, Akira and Fumi head off to Yokohama for a day to play. On that day, Fumi decided to stay over at Akira's place, making Yasuko a bit uneasy as she expressed her thoughts to Akira. After hearing Akira's thoughts on the matter, Yasuko decided to let it go. However, she later decides to invite Fumi to her home...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/avOumsF3jwMtVGZ6JjGKNhPW0hV.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6443","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34838","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"81297","synopsis":"Fujigaya's school newspaper announces that Mr. Kagami is getting married. He states that he had no prior knowledge of Yasuko's prior experience, after being cross examined by Kyouko. With all this going on, Yasuko has been giving Fumi the cold shoulder, and, unwilling to take any more of this, Akira confronts Yasuko on behalf of Fumi...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9c3S4h4jYWPr83pLwCIFg4dIV0X.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Fujigaya's school newspaper announces that Mr. Kagami is getting married. He states that he had no prior knowledge of Yasuko's prior experience, after being cross examined by Kyouko. With all this going on, Yasuko has been giving Fumi the cold shoulder, and, unwilling to take any more of this, Akira confronts Yasuko on behalf of Fumi...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9c3S4h4jYWPr83pLwCIFg4dIV0X.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6443","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6164","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34838","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102011","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"81299","synopsis":"Summer vacation arrives, and Kyouko starts inviting people to a summer trip, even to Kou Sawanoi. It seems like everyone's invited except, Akira and Fumi. However, they are plenty busy with other plans for the summer holiday. However on Kyouko's camping trip during a \"test of courage\" activity, Kou debates whether or not to reveal a huge secret...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/98Q175JPI7DlOSeJ187wKa7vBlc.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Summer vacation arrives, and Kyouko starts inviting people to a summer trip, even to Kou Sawanoi. It seems like everyone's invited except, Akira and Fumi. However, they are plenty busy with other plans for the summer h